; pos=fail warn=0 error=2
; A PROJ pipeline is an operation rather than a coordinate system, so PROJ
; can't build a transform from it.  Each *fix must report that rather than
; crash.
*cs out EPSG:32616
*cs custom "+proj=pipeline +step +proj=unitconvert +xy_in=m +xy_out=m"
*fix a 500000 4000000 100
*fix c 500100 4000000 100
*data normal from to tape compass clino
a b 10 0 0
b c 90 0 0
